0..77 Comment "//! A peer still waiting when its counterpart abandons the rest is cancelled,"
78..121 Comment "//! and the run answers its clause\'s value."
122..125 Comment "//!"
126..201 Comment "//! The abandoned rest held an end whose protocol had not ended, so it owed"
202..280 Comment "//! its peer a cancellation. The peer\'s next action on its own end observes it"
281..330 Comment "//! and abandons the peer\'s continuation in turn."
331..334 Comment "//!"
335..410 Comment "//! Each program below abandons its root\'s rest through an exit clause that"
411..487 Comment "//! answers `7`. A peer parked at a receive is readied and abandoned, and an"
488..544 Comment "//! end queued at an abandoned end is cancelled with it."
545..548 Comment "//!"
549..590 Comment "//! - see: #3305 — the cancellation hop"
591..673 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types] — cancellation"
674..744 Comment "//!   reaching the peer and every end left in a cancelled end\'s buffer"
745..748 Comment "//!"
749..915 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3290341 \"Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types\""
